msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Uma kubalwa Imikhawulo Yesisho, uma i-ifHighSpeed ne-ifSpeed kubuya kunguziro, sebenzisa lesi silungiselelo esilandelayo se-ifHighSpeed esikhundleni salokho. I-ifHighSpeed emisiwe izoba ngu-10000 ezikhulwini ze-10GE."

