#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Khubaza Izaziso Ezindala"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Ukumaka leli bhokisi kuzokhubaza Izexwayiso Ezindala kuyo yonke Imikhawulo. Izexwayiso Ezindala zichazwa njenganoma yiziphi Izexwayiso Ze-imeyili Eziqondile ezingahlobene noHlu Lwezaziso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Izaziso Zomkhawulo Ezinesifanekiso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, uma kwakhiwa Isifanekiso SoMkhawulo, Izilungiselelo Zaso Zezaziso, ngokuzenzakalela, zizoba ngezeSifanekiso SoMkhawulo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Nika amandla Ukusebenza Kwemiyalo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Ukumaka leli bhokisi kuzonika amandla ikhono lokusebenzisa imiyalo ezenzakalweni zokwephulwa koMkhawulo nezokubuyisela."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Nika amandla Isaziso Nge-Thold Ngayinye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Ukumaka leli bhokisi kuzonika amandla ikhono lokugcina imizimba ye-imeyili yangokwezifiso yeMikhawulo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Nika amandla Umugqa Wezaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Ukumaka leli bhokisi kuzoshintsha i-Thold kusuka ekwenzeni Isaziso sangaphakathi kuya ekusebenziseni i-Notification Daemon, noma izaziso ezenziwa ngaphandle kwebhendi yi-Poller Yezaziso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Nika amandla Ukuthumela Ama-imeyili Ezixwayiso Ezinhlwini Zezaziso Zesexwayiso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Maka leli bhokisi uma ufisa ukuthi abamukeli boHlu Lwezaziso Zesexwayiso bathole Ama-imeyili Esexwayiso Esiphuthumayo ngaphezu kwabamukeli bohlu Lwezaziso Zesexwayiso Esiphuthumayo. Lesi simo siyasebenza uma Izaziso Zesexwayiso ziya Kubalawuli futhi Izaziso Zesexwayiso Esiphuthumayo ziya Kubaphathi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "I-Daemon Yomkhawulo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Nika amandla I-Daemon Yomkhawulo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Ukumaka leli bhokisi kuzonika amandla ukusetshenziswa kwe-daemon yoMkhawulo ezinikele. Lokhu kungasetshenziselwa ukukhulisa ukusebenza kwesistimu kanye/noma ukusabalalisa ukuqapha koMkhawulo kuseva ehlukile."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Phoqa Ukulungiswa Kwephutha Kwe-Daemon Yomkhawulo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Ukumaka leli bhokisi kuzonika amandla ukulungisa amaphutha kwe-Threshold Daemon lapho isebenza kusuka ku-SystemD noma ngomugqa womyalo. Lolu shintsho luyaguquguquka futhi luzosebenza ngokushesha nje lapho iluphu elandelayo yoMkhawulo iqala."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Imvamisa Yesaziso Sokuma Kwe-Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Uma i-Thold Daemon itholakala iphansi, thumela isaziso Se-imeyili ngalobu buningi."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Njalo Ngehora Elingu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
