msgstr "Bonisa Umthombo Wedatha kuLogi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Bonisa igama Lomthombo Wedatha kuLogi uma lingekho."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Bhala Elogini Izinguquko Zomkhawulo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Nika amandla ukuloga kwazo zonke izinguquko zoMkhawulo kuLog ye-Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Ilogi Yokulungisa Amaphutha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Nika amandla ukuloga kwemilayezo yokulungisa iphutha ngoMkhawulo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Ukugcinwa Kwelogi Yezaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Gcina Amalogi Omkhawulo leli nani lezinsuku."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Bhala elogini isenzo sokuthatha idatha engaziwa njengeziro"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Lapho okuthi 'Bheka Idatha Engaziwa Njengeqanda' kunikwe amandla, gcina irekhodi uma kwenzeka"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo ze-Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "I-Syslog Inikwe Amandla"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, uma kwakhiwa Umkhawulo omusha, ngokuzenzakalela izenzakalo ezintsha zoMkhawulo zizothunyelwa ku-syslog yakho yendawo. Lesi silungiselelo silungiselwe kusengaphambili. Izilungiselelo zoMkhawulo zilawula ukuphathwa kwangempela kwe-syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Okubalulekile/Izinga Okuzenzakalelayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Leli yizinga Lokubaluleka elizenzakalelayo elizosetshenziswa yi-Thold ukuthumela imilayezo ye-syslog. Lesi silungiselelo sasethelwa ngaphambilini. Izilungiselelo Zomkhawulo zilawula ukulawulwa kwangempela kwe-syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "I-Facility Ezenzakalelayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Lesi yisikhungo esizenzakalelayo (Facility) esizosetshenziswa yi-Thold ukuthumela imilayezo ye-syslog. Lesi silungiselelo sasethelwa ngaphambilini. Izilungiselelo Zomkhawulo zilawula ukulawulwa kwangempela kwe-syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Izimiso Ezihleliwe Zesaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Ukukhululwa kwempelasonto"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Uma lokhu kukhethiwe, i-Thold ngeke isebenze ngezimpelasonto."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Isibalo Sokuqalisa Esizenzakalelayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Inani elizenzakalelayo lezikhathi ezilandelanayo lapho Umthombo Wedatha kumele weqe khona Umkhawulo ukuze kuphakanyiswe Isixwayiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Ukuxwayisa Kabusha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Phinda Isexwayiso ngemva kwenani elishiwo lemijikelezo ye-Poller."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Okusethwe Ngaphambilini Kwesisekelo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Ububanzi Besikhathi Sesisekelo Obuzenzakalelayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Leli yilona nani elizenzakalelayo elisetshenziswa ekudaleni Imikhawulo noma izifanekiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Isibalo Sokuqubula Sesisekelo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Inani elizenzakalelayo lezikhathi ezilandelanayo lapho Umthombo Wedatha kumele weqe khona Umkhawulo Wesisekelo obaliwe ukuze kuphakanyiswe Isixwayiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Iphesenti Lokuphambuka Kwesisekelo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zezaziso ze-SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "Izaziso ze-SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Imilayezo yesimo somkhawulo (ama-inform/ama-trap) izothunyelwa kubamukeli bezaziso ze-SNMP. Lokhu kufaka phakathi Izaziso Ezibucayi, Izexwayiso kanye nama-trap okubuyisela ngokuzenzakalelayo. Qaphela: Lesi sici sidinga i-plugin ye-Cacti SNMPAgent."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Khubaza Izaziso Zesexwayiso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Uma lokhu kukhethiwe, Umkhawulo ngeke uthumele isaziso lapho Umkhawulo wesexwayiso weqiwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Khubaza Izaziso Zokubuyisela"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Uma lokhu kukhethiwe, Umkhawulo ngeke uthumele isaziso lapho Umkhawulo ubuyele esimweni esijwayelekile."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Izinketho zokuthumela i-imeyili"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Thumela Ama-imeyili Ngokubaluleka Okuphuthumayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Kukuvumela ukuthi usethe Ama-imeyili ngokubaluleka okuphuthumayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Thumela Izexwayiso Njengombhalo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, lokhu kuzokwenza ukuthi zonke Izexwayiso zithunyelwe njengama-imeyili ombhalo ongenalutho angenayo igrafu. Okuzenzakalelayo ngama-imeyili e-HTML anegrafu efakwe ngaphakathi ku-imeyili."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Thumela I-imeyili ngokwehlukana kulelo nalelo kheli"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, lokhu kuzokwenza ukuthi wonke ama-imeyili athunyelwe ngokuhlukana ekhelini ngalinye."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Ikheli le-imeyili lomthumeli"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Leli yikheli Le-imeyili elizovela kulo Umkhawulo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Igama lomthumeli"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Leli yigama langempela elizovela kulo Umkhawulo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zesaziso Sedivayisi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Nika amandla Izaziso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Nika amandla isaziso somsingathi Ofile/Olulamayo"

#: includes/settings.php
